# Exact OPAM closure of the CI-only Eio integration example (examples/eio).
#
# Format: <package> <exact version>
#
# Dockerfile.dev's `examples-eio` stage and the native macOS lane install these
# packages on top of the locked SDK closure with scripts/opam-tool-lock.sh,
# which fails if opam adds any package not listed here or moves a locked SDK
# package. They are dependencies of one example executable only: no package
# here is a dependency of temporal-sdk, is linked into any SDK library, or is
# redistributed with an SDK artifact. Packages already pinned by
# temporal-sdk.opam.locked (dune, mtime, ocamlfind, topkg) are reused at their
# locked versions and are not repeated here; dune-configurator is pinned to the
# locked dune release so the install cannot move dune. The closure was solved
# for the OCaml 5.5 image that builds the live smoke executables, and
# `make license-check` audits every entry; see docs/dependencies.md.
bigstringaf 0.10.0
csexp 1.5.2
cstruct 6.3.0
domain-local-await 1.0.1
dune-configurator 3.24.2
eio 1.6
eio_posix 1.6
fmt 0.11.0
hmap 0.8.1
iomux 0.4
lwt-dllist 1.1.0
optint 0.3.0
psq 0.2.1
seq base
thread-table 1.0.0
